message: "If you use this code or build on this work, please cite the article below."
type: software
title: "Learning heterogeneous delays in a layer of spiking neurons for fast motion detection"
abstract: >-
  Code for reproducing the results of the article: a layer of spiking neurons
  equipped with heterogeneous synaptic delays, formalised as a time-invariant
  logistic regression, detects temporal spiking motifs (visual motion) in
  event streams.
